    "MissionGiver": "United Wayfarers Club",
    "Title": "CRITICAL FLEET REFUEL",
    "TitleKey": "UWC_Refueling_multiple_hard_title_001",
    "Description": "Heyo,\n\nOver at <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4> we just got a refueling job for an entire small fleet of ships who all together need ~mission(FuelType). Talk about when it rains it pours!\n\nThe client will pay you at the rate of ~mission(RefuelRequest), and as a United Wayfarers Club contractor, you will also qualify for the UWC service fee listed above upon completion.\n\nUnfortunately, where they're held up isn't the nicest of sectors so I'd be alert for any tomfoolery while you're doing the run. \n\nIt'll be best to try get them all back on their way as soon as you can.\n\nHappy trails,\n\nDina Deloit\nDispatch Hub\nUnited Wayfarers Club\n\"We\u2019ve got your back\"",
    "DescriptionKey": "UWC_Refueling_multiple_hard_desc_001",
    "DisplayDescription": "Heyo,\n\nOver at <EM4>Asteroid Mining Base</EM4> we just got a refueling job for an entire small fleet of ships who all together need <EM4>[HydrogenFuel] SCU of Hydrogen and [QTFuel] SCU of Quantum Fuel</EM4>. Talk about when it rains it pours!\n\nThe client will pay you at the rate of <EM4>[FuelRate] aUEC per SCU of Hydrogen</EM4> and  <EM4>[QTFuelRate] aUEC per SCU of Quantum</EM4>, and as a United Wayfarers Club contractor, you will also qualify for the UWC service fee listed above upon completion.\n\nUnfortunately, where they're held up isn't the nicest of sectors so I'd be alert for any tomfoolery while you're doing the run. \n\nIt'll be best to try get them all back on their way as soon as you can.\n\nHappy trails,\n\nDina Deloit\nDispatch Hub\nUnited Wayfarers Club\n\"We\u2019ve got your back\"",
